IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. ACTIVECUST.

ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.

    SELECT CUST-MASTER
    ASSIGN TO "CustomerRecord/Files/CUST-MASTER"
    ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
    RECORD KEY IS CUST-ID
    FILE STATUS IS WS-MASTER-STATUS.

DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.

FD CUST-MASTER.

01 CUST-MASTER-RECORD.
    05 CUST-ID PIC X(12).
    05 CUST-NAME PIC X(25).
    05 CUST-STATUS PIC X(6).

WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

01 WS-MASTER-STATUS PIC XX.
01 WS-EOF PIC X VALUE 'N'.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.

    OPEN I-O CUST-MASTER

    IF WS-MASTER-STATUS NOT = '00'
        DISPLAY 'ERROR OPENING CUSTOMER MASTER'
        DISPLAY 'FILE STATUS: ' WS-MASTER-STATUS
        STOP RUN
    END-IF

    PERFORM UNTIL WS-EOF = 'Y'
        READ CUST-MASTER NEXT RECORD
        AT END
            MOVE 'Y' TO WS-EOF
        NOT AT END
            IF CUST-STATUS = 'CLOSED'
                MOVE 'ACTIVE' TO CUST-STATUS
                REWRITE CUST-MASTER-RECORD
            END-IF
        END-READ
    END-PERFORM

    CLOSE CUST-MASTER
STOP RUN.    
